  "uri": "./energy-ade3-v1.1.ext.json",
  "version": "0.1",
  "versionCityJSON": "1.1",
  "description": "Energy ADE 3.0 beta 7 extras on CityJSON 1.1. Core objects stay Building so ninja and cjval can read the geometry. ADE 3 libraries, zones, devices and party-wall CityObjects are +Energy-* extras. Not the registry energy-space-heating extension (KIT / ADE 1). Party walls draw as WallSurface (no extraSemanticSurfaces in 1.1).",
